---
title: Potato Gnocchi w/ Sage Brown Butter Sauce
servings: 2
cookTime: 20 min
Rating: 8/10
Description: Used Racconto Potato Gnocchi. Cool completely if storing, in glass container, keeps 7-10 days. Unsalted butter is better. Browned milk solids should be served - that's all the flavor!
tags: Sides
---

Prepare the @Racconto Potato Gnocchi{}(or other brand) per the package directions.

Melt the @unsalted butter{8%Tbsp} over low-medium heat.
When the butter begins to bubble, add the @garlic{1%clove}(chopped).
Cook 1 minute, then add the @sage leaves{1/4%cup}(fresh, chopped).

Cook until the butter is light brown and nutty.
Season with @salt and @pepper to taste.

Coat the gnocchi in the butter sauce and serve hot.
